WEBVTT

00:24:29.539 --> 00:24:30.785
on the other hand,

00:24:30.809 --> 00:24:32.935
there will be fewer people doing VCs

00:24:32.959 --> 00:24:35.673
and that's not good
for the entrepreneurial ecosystem."

00:24:35.697 --> 00:24:37.460
Then the government listened to it

00:24:37.484 --> 00:24:41.208
and decided, OK,
let's pull back on the taxes.

00:24:41.232 --> 00:24:45.708
So if there were
significant numbers of people

00:24:45.732 --> 00:24:48.272
who complain about aspects of the system,

00:24:48.296 --> 00:24:51.680
I do think the government
wants to please the people

00:24:51.704 --> 00:24:55.061
and are likely to listen to this feedback.

00:24:55.752 --> 00:24:58.704
CA: Well, certainly to please
the people who have power.

00:24:58.728 --> 00:25:02.006
What you're enabling in China
is pretty incredible.